atom_style granular
atom_modify map array
boundary f f f
newton off
communicate single vel yes
units si
region dom block -0.011 0.011 -0.003 0.003 -0.011 0.011 units box
create_box 1 dom
neighbor 0.0002 bin
neigh_modify delay 0
fix p1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 100000000.0
fix p2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.3
fix p3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 1 0.5
fix p4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 1 0.5
fix p5 all property/global coefficientRollingFriction peratomtypepair 1 0.1
fix p6 all property/global coefficientRollingViscousDamping peratomtypepair 1 0.1
pair_style gran model hertz tangential history  twisting_marshall on
pair_coeff * *
fix drum all mesh/surface file drum_R10mm.stl type 1
fix wall all wall/gran model hertz tangential history  mesh n_meshes 1 meshes drum twisting_marshall on
fix rot all move/mesh mesh drum rotate origin 0 0 0 axis 0 1 0 period 0.12566370614359174
create_atoms 1 single 0.0090004999999999998 0 0 units box
set atom * diameter 0.002 density 2500.0
velocity all set 0 0 -0.45002500000000001 units box
set atom 1 omegay 50.0
timestep 2e-7
fix integr all nve/sphere
compute om all property/atom omegay
compute oms all reduce sum c_om
variable x1 equal x[1]
variable z1 equal z[1]
variable vx1 equal vx[1]
variable vz1 equal vz[1]
thermo_style custom step v_x1 v_z1 v_vx1 v_vz1 c_oms ke
thermo_modify format float %.17g norm no
thermo 5000
run 1500000
